    "heading": "Reduce heat",
    "lineStart": 2206,
    "lineEnd": 2210
  },
  "rulesText": "Say what your character does to reduce the **heat** level of the crew and make an action roll. Maybe you **Consort** with your friend who's a officer and she arranges for a few incriminating Watch reports to disappear. Or maybe you **Command** the fear of the local citizens so they're afraid to snitch.\n\nReduce **heat** according to the result: **1-3**: one, **4/5**: two, **6**: three, **critical**: five."
}
